{"id":"ronde","lemma":"ronde","pos":"noun","rank":3343,"glosses":["a watch (a period of time when guards are posted)","a traditional dance where the dancers form a ring and move laterally with the music","a whole note, a semibreve"],"ipa":"/ʁɔ̃d/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c9/Fr-ronde.ogg/Fr-ronde.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"rondes"},"formAudio":{"rondes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a4/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-rondes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Nous avons acheté une table ronde.","en":"We bought a round table.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to purchase","l":"acheter"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"table"},null]},{"text":"La Terre est ronde.","en":"The earth is round.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"earth"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"Il est vrai que la Terre est ronde.","en":"It is true that the earth is round.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/28035","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"true"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"earth"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"Je veux jeter un nouveau regard à la ronde.","en":"I want to take another look around.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"to throw"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"new, novel"},{"g":"look, glance"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[6,8,"a la"]]},{"text":"Nous avons acquis une table ronde.","en":"We bought a round table.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"acquired, learned"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"table"},null]}]}